> Converted from personal notes. Amounts are for one serving. Directions are editorial, not verified source instructions.

> REVIEW: Range 3/5 to 1: upper amount 1 selected for shopping. | Unspecified amount: Salt + pepper

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @sweet potatoes{2/5%lb} (cubed), @chickpeas{2/5%can} (can size 15 oz ea; drained), @quinoa{1/5%cup} (dry), @baby spinach{4/5%cup}, @avocados{2/5} (sliced), @broccoli florets{2/5%cup}, @olive oil{3/5%tbsp}, @smoked paprika{1/5%tsp}, @cumin{1/5%tsp}, @tahini{1/15%cup}, @lemon juice{3/5%tbsp}, @garlic clove{1/5} (minced), @maple syrup{2/5%tsp}, @water{1%tbsp}, @Salt + pepper{}.

== Preparation ==

Cook quinoa. Roast sweet potato, chickpeas and broccoli with olive oil, paprika and cumin. Whisk tahini, lemon, garlic, maple syrup and water. Assemble with spinach and avocado and drizzle with dressing.
